<v Alex Blumberg>你把它当作筹码了吗——

00:26:58.960 --> 00:27:08.190
<v Shane Dubow>Yes, yes. I probably said something like, "Well, you know, I can only get $300."
<v Shane Dubow>是的，是的。我大概说了一些像“嗯，你知道，我只能取出300美元”这样的话。

00:27:08.190 --> 00:27:11.150
<v Alex Blumberg>From that point on, they knew they were dealing with a high roller.
<v Alex Blumberg>从那一刻起，他们就知道他们面对的是个大户。

00:27:11.150 --> 00:27:32.770
<v Shane Dubow>They had no idea who they were messing with. So now I'm past thinking that it's a speaker scam. Now I'm on to thinking, well, if I do this, I'm somehow criminally liable. And I don't want to get busted. So I--
<v Shane Dubow>他们根本不知道自己在招惹谁。现在我不再认为这是个扬声器骗局了。现在我开始想，好吧，如果我这样做，我在某种程度上是有刑事责任的。我不想被抓。所以我——

00:27:32.770 --> 00:27:34.420
<v Alex Blumberg>Because you think they're stolen.
<v Alex Blumberg>因为你以为它们是偷来的。

00:27:34.420 --> 00:27:43.130
<v Shane Dubow>Well, these guys, if their story is true, they essentially stole them. So we're at the cash station. I've taken out the money. They're waiting in the car.
<v Shane Dubow>嗯，这些人，如果他们的故事是真的，他们基本上就是偷了它们。所以我们在自动取款机那儿。我已经取出了钱。他们在车里等。

00:27:43.130 --> 00:28:09.400
<v Shane Dubow>I already have the speakers at my place, at my mom's place, that is. And I go to give them the money through the car window. And I've already written down the license plate. And I say, "If I go down, I'm taking you guys with me."
<v Shane Dubow>我已经在我的住处，也就是我妈家，放好了音箱。我从车窗把钱递给他们。我已经记下了车牌号。我说，“如果我要倒霉，我会拉着你们一起下水。”

00:28:09.400 --> 00:28:28.990
<v Shane Dubow>The next thing that happens is I come home to my new speakers. I think, well, I'm going to find out just how much money I essentially made. I'm going to call the high-end audio store and ask them how much they sell the Pro Musica 555, whatever they are.
<v Shane Dubow>接下来发生的是我带着新音箱回到家。我想，好吧，我要看看我到底赚了多少钱。我要打电话给高端音响店，问他们Pro Musica 555或其他什么型号卖多少钱。

00:28:28.990 --> 00:28:46.160
<v Shane Dubow>And I call the guy, I say, "How much do you sell, what do you know about the Pro Musica 555s?" He's like, "Hold on a second." He puts down the phone and comes back. He goes, "Did someone try to sell you those?" And I was like, "Yeah, someone did try to sell me those."
