00:31:14.190 --> 00:31:40.450
<v Shane Dubow>And then he starts mocking me like nobody's business. He's like, "Oooh, tough guy. Think we're scared? Response time is 10 minutes. We'll be out of here," blah blah blah. And all the guys, it was like the monkey cage in the van. They're like, "Oo-oo-oo-ooh. Oh, scary. Oo-oo-oo-ooh."
<v Shane Dubow>然后他开始肆无忌惮地嘲笑我。他说，“噢，硬汉。以为我们怕了？响应时间是10分钟。我们那时早走了，”巴拉巴拉。车里的所有人都像猴子笼一样。他们说，“噢噢噢噢。噢，好怕怕。噢噢噢噢。”

00:31:40.450 --> 00:32:05.400
<v Shane Dubow>And it's just, it's just so wrong. It's so embarrassing. And my retreat was so awful. In my mind, I'm slouching and hunchbacked and kind of worming my way to the pay phone. There's no quick calls.
